 "window_rule": "candidate if any window [lo,hi] satisfies lo-1 <= year <= hi+1 (year = TEI frus:doc-dateTime-min). POCOM windows = appointment spans (min..max of all <date> in the chief/principal block, m1a's rule). Registry / authority index / persons-complete windows = life window (birth+18..death; one-sided: b+18..b+85 or d-65..d; INFERRED rule) UNION manifest dateRange of every volume that lists the person. Live-index rollups = dateRange of member volumes. Entities with no window are 'undated' and never counted as candidates (reported separately)."
